    "title_en": "Multiscale Loop Vertex Expansion for Cumulants, the $ϕ^4_2$ Model",
    "abstract_en": "We consider the $ϕ^4_2$ model. It has been called the simplest non- trivial super-renormalisable model. The method we use is the multiscale loop vertex expansion, an improvement of constructive field theory. We prove analyticity and Borel summability of the cumulants up to a finite order.",
